# Every tracked file in this repository is LF. Declare it, so a checkout on
# Windows — where git defaults to core.autocrlf=true — does not rewrite them to
# CRLF.
#
# This is not cosmetic. pipe/reference_test.go compares docs/OPERATORS.md
# byte-for-byte against what the catalog generates, and the generator emits LF.
# A CRLF checkout made that test fail on windows-latest only, reporting the
# reference as "stale" when nothing about the catalog had changed.
#
# text=auto still lets git detect and leave binary files alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
